(Now cargo_available false.)
(10. unload_destination_payload da dnA rt cargo_payload_alpha)
(Pre: candidate_prepared da true, candidate_task_profile_linked da rt true (we have), destination_node_occupied dnA true, destination_payload_linked da cargo_payload_alpha true, not destination_availability_confirmed da (currently false). Effect: destination_node_ready dnA, destination_availability_confirmed da true, cargo_available true, not destination_payload_linked da.)
(Now after unload, we have destination_node_occupied true, destination_node_ready true, destination_availability_locked da true (still true from load), destination_availability_confirmed da true, cargo_available true.)
(Now we can detach rt from da if needed later.)
