(We'll need to allocate dispatch slot to oa, dispatch oa.)
(Similarly for da.)
(Now for sa and sb we need to prepare, link operator, skill cert, compliance cert, load container, stage, verify loading, establish clearance, finalize, allocate slot, dispatch.)
