(We also need to set origin_node_occupied and ready, destination_node_occupied and ready (we already have from load/unload).)
(We need to set transport_leg_origin_linked and destination_linked (from assemble_transport_leg).)
(We need to set transport_leg_loading_authorized (from authorize_transport_leg_loading).)
